2026-10-09T19:43:03.6147094Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6160589Z [0m
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6162389Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6163835Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6169713Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6170774Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6171747Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6172335Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6172743Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6173609Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6173969Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6174598Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6175455Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6176135Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6176713Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6177296Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6177711Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6178190Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6178649Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6179283Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6179581Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6179907Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6180260Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6181008Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6181858Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6182301Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6182566Z I will:
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6182870Z 
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6184249Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6185147Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6185963Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6186676Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6187098Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6187499Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6188312Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6188992Z    /root
2026-10-09T19:43:03.6189748Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
